00:00:45.304 --> 00:00:46.137
I'm just saying,

00:00:46.137 --> 00:00:48.750
that belt buckle is very Texan, I like it.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:50.790
You came out and that's all I saw.

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:51.623
Yeah, that's all I saw,

