00:00:57.241 --> 00:00:58.608
I was watching.
(both laughing)

00:00:58.608 --> 00:00:59.740
Yes, a lot in common.
- How are you?

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:02.130
- And I speak French so
I can teach you French.

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:04.170
