00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:11.160
So how are you and your grandson?

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:11.993
This is exciting.

00:01:11.993 --> 00:01:14.310
- Yes, well he's two years and two months

00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:18.896
